v 3
d 'XLPOLISH': finishing touches for Excel files written by putexcel or export excel
d
d xlpolish adds what putexcel and export excel cannot set: freeze panes,
d filter dropdowns, auto-fit column widths, conditional formatting (colour
d scales, data bars, highlight rules), in-cell dropdown lists, cell notes,
d row and column grouping, sheet protection with editable cells, hidden
d sheets, tab colours, zoom and print setup. It runs on Stata's built-in
d Java and needs no Excel, Python or PowerShell. Requires Stata 16 or newer.
d
d Author: Fahad Mirza
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261030
f xlpolish.ado
f xlpolish.sthlp
f xlpolish.jar
a xlpolish_test.do
